- Line 518 (S41): "MPS bond dim of chi_P at base-W half cut" — Theorem: rank = min(W^j, phi(W)*W^{d-j-1}+1); half-cut ratio chi_P/random = phi(W)/W; recovers sqrt(N) Lagarias-Odlyzko barrier without zeta zeros
