    | Linear-dynamical-system / fast-forward sieve via CP/Tucker rank of alive-vector (S48-fresh) | FAIL | E | Two complementary measurements. (a) Wheel factorization: coprime-to-{p_1..p_K} indicator restricted to one primorial period is rank-1 in CRT tensor basis (verified K=3,4,5); evaluation O(K log p_K) per query. Stops applying once primorial(K) > N, which for K = π(√N) gives primorial ≈ exp(√N) ≫ N — only constant-factor wheel speedup. (b) Reshape rank: 4096-length alive-vector after sieving primes ≤13 has 64×64 unfolding rank exactly 32 = N^{1/2}/2, matching S41/E2.1 closed-form rank(π_N)=2^{N/2−1}+2 at midpoint cut. No matrix-exponentiation fast-forward exists. See experiments/wildcard/parallel_sieve_matrix_exp.py | 48 |
